	<key>readme</key>
	<string># WordPing setup

WordPing uses the Youdao translation API. Create or reuse a Youdao AI Cloud application and enter its app key and secret in this workflow's configuration.

1. Sign in at https://ai.youdao.com/ and create a Natural Language Translation service.
2. Create an application and bind the translation service to it.
3. Enter the application ID and secret in the setup form shown beside this guide.
4. Choose your native language and online pronunciation accent from the dropdowns.
6. Use the `wp` keyword followed by a word or phrase.

Existing YoudaoTranslator users can use the same app key and secret. Alfred keeps the two workflows' settings separately, so enter them in WordPing once.</string>
